## Prerequisites

- Rust — https://rustup.rs (`rise doctor` checks this machine)
{%- if 'grpc' in backend.features %}
- protoc, to build the gRPC service — https://grpc.io/docs/protoc-installation/
{%- endif %}
{%- if backend.database not in ['sqlite', 'sled'] %}
- a Postgres database — `.env.example` has the URL shape
{%- endif %}

## Run

```sh
{%- if backend.database not in ['sqlite', 'sled'] or 'auth' in backend.features %}
cp .env.example .env  # {% if backend.database not in ['sqlite', 'sled'] %}set DATABASE_URL{% if 'auth' in backend.features %} and JWT_SECRET{% endif %}{% else %}set JWT_SECRET{% endif %}
{%- endif %}
cargo run
```

The server listens on http://localhost:3000.
{%- if 'web-sockets' in backend.features %}
`/ws` is a WebSocket echo endpoint.
{%- endif %}
{%- if 'graph-ql' in backend.features %}
`/graphql` answers GraphQL queries (POST) and serves GraphiQL (GET).
{%- endif %}
{%- if 'grpc' in backend.features %}
The gRPC Greeter service listens on :50051.
{%- endif %}
{%- if 'auth' in backend.features %}
`POST /auth/register` + `POST /auth/login` issue JWTs; `/api/me` takes one
as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.
{%- endif %}

